@startuml
' Source Use Case: UC-022 — Evaluate Candidate Garment
' Primary Specification: ../use-cases/UC-022-evaluate-candidate-garment.md
' Supporting Authorities: ../SRS.md (v0.3); ../business-rules.md (v0.1.2)
' Business/Product: ../../01-business/BRD.md (v0.3); ../../02-product/PRD.md (v0.2)
' Master Actors/Scope: ../use-cases/use-case-diagram.puml
' Process Authority: ../../../Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 11, 39–42, 46
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft
' SRS trace: FR-MULT-001, FR-MULT-002, FR-MULT-003, FR-MULT-004, FR-MULT-005, FR-MULT-006, FR-MULT-007, FR-MULT-008, DATA-ANL-004, DATA-OUT-001, ERR-ANL-001, ERR-ANL-002, ERR-SHOP-001
' Rule trace: BRULE-AUTH-001, BRULE-MULT-001, BRULE-MULT-002, BRULE-MULT-003, BRULE-MULT-004, BRULE-MULT-005, BRULE-MULT-006, BRULE-MULT-007, BRULE-MULT-008, BRULE-MULT-009
' Flow coverage: UC Sections 6–10; alternatives and failures retain their textual meaning.
' The textual Use Case Specification remains the normative behavioral source.

title AD-022 - Evaluate Candidate Garment
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

|User|
start
:Select hypothetical candidate from supported advice;
:Request evaluation or reevaluation;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Authorized wardrobe/candidate access usable?) then (Yes)
    :Identify hypothetical candidate and authorized baseline;
else (No)
    :Pause protected use; require renewed access (UC-002);
    stop
endif
:Identify current confirmed active owned W,
candidate descriptors and shared context/rule basis;
if (Relevant prior result basis changed?) then (Yes)
    :Label prior count/previews Outdated;
endif
:Show pending evaluation until status established;
if (Evaluation capability can operate?) then (Yes)
else (Unavailable)
    :Show Unavailable; preserve useful candidate/gap context;
    :Do not substitute +0 or restore prior Exact status;
    |User|
    :Retry evaluation when useful or return to available advice;
    stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
if (Required credible inputs/readiness sufficient?) then (Yes)
else (Insufficient)
    :Show Incomplete; explain missing inputs/readiness;
    :Withhold current exact count and new-outfit previews;
    |User|
    :Revise inputs through existing goals; request reevaluation;
    stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
:Evaluate current unique valid outfit set O(W);
:Evaluate hypothetical expanded set O(W union {candidate});
:Use same context/rules and garment-identity uniqueness;
if (Both evaluations and deduplication complete?) then (Yes)
else (Partial / unestablished)
    :Show Incomplete; explain partial/timed-out work;
    :Do not claim exact +N or completed +0;
    |User|
    :Retry when useful or return to candidate/gap advice;
    stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
if (Relevant evaluation basis still current?) then (Yes)
else (Changed)
    :Show Outdated; withhold current exact count/previews;
    |User|
    :Request current reevaluation when useful;
    stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
:Compare expanded and current unique valid outfit sets;
:Identify incremental valid outfit utility;
note right
  Wardrobe Multiplier is
  |O(W union {candidate}) minus O(W)|.
  Complete sets share one evaluation basis.
  Optional commercial fields do not gate utility.
end note
if (Result information available?) then (Yes)
else (Retrieval failure)
    :Explain unavailable result information;
    :Retain only established status/basis;
    |User|
    :Retry result/evaluation or return to available advice;
    stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
if (Incremental set empty?) then (Yes)
    :Show Evaluated Zero and +0 New Outfits;
    :Explain completed zero; create no new previews;
    |User|
    :Review utility and return to advice;
    stop
else (Positive)
    |CapsuleAI|
    :Show Exact +N New Outfits and reasons;
endif
|User|
if (Request newly enabled previews?) then (Yes)
else (Decline)
    :Continue core/advice without previews or shopping;
    stop
endif
repeat
    |CapsuleAI|
    if (Preview basis still current?) then (Yes)
        :Retrieve same-assessment candidate-bearing previews;
    else (Changed)
        :Mark count/previews Outdated;
        |User|
        :Request current reevaluation when useful;
        stop
    endif
    |CapsuleAI|
    if (Previews available?) then (Yes)
        :Show hypothetical candidate and owned items distinctly;
        |User|
        :Inspect newly enabled outfits;
        stop
    else (Unavailable)
        |CapsuleAI|
        :Explain unavailable previews; retain established result;
        |User|
        :Choose preview retry or return;
    endif
repeat while (Retry preview retrieval?) is (Yes) not (No)
|CapsuleAI|
:Finish with established evaluation status;
note right
  Candidate stays unowned.
  Evaluation/viewing creates no Wear Event or purchase.
  Failed reevaluation does not make old results current.
end note
stop

@enduml
